</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/e0bbfc2c-b8d9-11f1-bdd6-11fa9f8a3b4f/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-09-24-13-05-26.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/e0bbfc2c-b8d9-11f1-bdd6-11fa9f8a3b4f/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-09-24-13-05-26.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">3f9c2512-b81e-11f1-9800-b97ecb5a4fe2</guid><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 14:04:57 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>Marc PERELMAN</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Macron says ‘military resources’ to be sent to Saudi Arabia</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/macron-says-military-resources-to-be-sent-to-saudi-arabia</link><description>
